 "notes": "Episode 7 pack atlas, merged into enemies_battle. Base frame <id> facing RIGHT, origin bottom-centre (the default; the `origin` table agrees). Derived <id>_idle_1, _attack, _hurt, _die_0..2 for every id, _cast for snow_wisp, hush_owl, frostbound_revenant, ice_knight, pale_lantern, rimed_page, closed_gate, lost_letter; anims <id>_idle and <id>_die. Draw 1x, untinted. rime_wolf, snow_wisp, hush_owl, crystal_crawler, ice_knight (enemies.png cells 2, 0, 6, 3, 5, recoloured snow white, ice blue, pine black and aurora violet), frostbound_revenant (cell 7 as painted, the skull redrawn), pale_lantern (cell 1 at 92 px, frost white with a great lantern in the hood, its light cold blue), rimed_page, closed_gate, lost_letter (drawn in code; the Gate and the Letter each stand on their own ground shadow). Every foe carries a dark outline and an ice-blue rim. The White Phantom lives in bosses_battle (see `external`)."
}
